 ></div\n          ><div class=\"message-content\"\n            ><div class=\"message-header\"\n              ><span class=\"message-name\">Sofia Davis</span><time class=\"message-time\">09:12</time></div\n            ><div class=\"bubble\" data-variant=\"secondary\"\n              ><div class=\"bubble-content\">Morning! How does the session scroll with a long thread?</div></div\n            ></div\n          ></div\n        >\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"session-item\" data-message-id=\"s6\">\n        <div class=\"message\" data-align=\"end\"\n          ><div class=\"message-avatar\"\n            ><span class=\"avatar\" data-size=\"sm\"\n              ><img class=\"avatar-image\" src=\"https://github.com/kyr0.png\" alt=\"You\" /><span class=\"avatar-fallback\"\n                >AH</span\n              ></span\n            ></div\n          ><div class=\"message-content\"\n            ><div class=\"bubble\"\n              ><div class=\"bubble-content\"\n                >It follows the newest message while you are at the bottom - scroll up and it lets go.</div\n              ></div\n            ></div\n          ></div\n        >\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"session-item\" data-message-id=\"s7\">\n        <div class=\"message\"\n          ><div class=\"message-avatar\"\n            ><span class=\"avatar\" data-size=\"sm\"\n              ><img class=\"avatar-image\" src=\"https://github.com/evilrabbit.png\" alt=\"Sofia Davis\" /><span\n                class=\"avatar-fallback\"\n                >SD</span\n              ></span\n            ></div\n          ><div class=\"message-content\"\n            ><div class=\"message-header\"\n              ><span class=\"message-name\">Sofia Davis</span><time class=\"message-time\">09:13</time></div\n            ><div class=\"bubble\" data-variant=\"secondary\"\n              ><div class=\"bubble-content\">And the arrow button brings me back?</div></div\n            ></div\n          ></div\n        >\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"session-item\" data-message-id=\"s8\">\n        <div class=\"message\" data-align=\"end\"\n          ><div class=\"message-avatar\"\n            ><span class=\"avatar\" data-size=\"sm\"\n              ><img class=\"avatar-image\" src=\"https://github.com/kyr0.png\" alt=\"You\" /><span class=\"avatar-fallback\"\n                >AH</span\n              ></span\n            ></div\n          ><div class=\"message-content\"\n            ><div class=\"bubble\"\n              ><div class=\"bubble-content\">Exactly. Try it - and drop an image anywhere on this window.</div></div\n            ></div\n          ></div\n        >\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <button\n      type=\"button\"\n      class=\"session-scroll-button\"\n      data-to=\"end\"\n      aria-label=\"Scroll to the latest message\"\n    ></button>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"session-footer\">\n    <form class=\"textarea-group\" data-layout=\"inline\" id=\"chat-composer\" aria-label=\"Message composer\">\n      <ul class=\"file-drop-list\" aria-label=\"Attachments\"></ul>\n      <div class=\"textarea-group-actions\">\n        <button\n          class=\"btn\"\n          data-variant=\"ghost\"\n          data-size=\"icon-sm\"\n          type=\"button\"\n          data-attach\n          aria-label=\"Attach images\"\n          ><i data-lucide=\"plus\"></i\n        ></button>\n        <input type=\"file\" accept=\"image/*\" multiple hidden data-files />\n      </div>\n      <textarea\n        class=\"textarea\"\n        data-rows=\"1\"\n        data-max-rows=\"5\"\n        name=\"message\"\n        placeholder=\"Message - Enter sends, Shift+Enter adds a line\"\n        aria-label=\"Message\"\n      ></textarea>\n      <div class=\"textarea-group-actions\">\n        <button class=\"btn\" data-size=\"icon-sm\" type=\"submit\" data-send aria-label=\"Send\" disabled\n          ><i data-lucide=\"arrow-up\"></i\n        ></button>\n      </div>\n    </form>\n  </div>\n</section>\n","individual":true},{"label":"Assistant: anchored turns and streaming","html":"<section\n  class=\"session\"\n  id=\"assistant\"\n  aria-label=\"Assistant\"\n  data-default-position=\"last-anchor\"\n  style=\"height: 28rem\"\n>\n  <div class=\"session-viewport\" aria-label=\"Conversation\">\n    <div class=\"session-content\">\n      <div class=\"session-item\" data-message-id=\"a1\" data-anchor\n        ><div class=\"message\" data-align=\"end\" data-avatar=\"none\"\n          ><div class=\"message-content\"\n            ><div class=\"bubble\"\n              ><div class=\"bubble-content\">What makes a session different from a plain message list?</div></div\n            ></div\n          ></div\n        ></div\n      >\n      <div class=\"session-item\" data-message-id=\"a1-r\"\n        ><div class=\"message\" data-avatar=\"none\"\n          ><div class=\"message-content\"\n            ><div class=\"bubble\" data-variant=\"ghost\"\n              ><div class=\"bubble-content\"\n                >It scrolls like a chat: it follows new messages while you are at the bottom, lets go when you read\n                history, and keeps your place when older messages load.</div\n              ></div\n            ></div\n          ></div\n        ></div\n      >\n      <div class=\"session-item\" data-message-id=\"a2\" data-anchor\n        ><div class=\"message\" data-align=\"end\" data-avatar=\"none\"\n          ><div class=\"message-content\"\n            ><div class=\"bubble\"><div class=\"bubble-content\">What does data-anchor do?</div></div></div\n          ></div\n        ></div\n      >\n      <div class=\"session-item\" data-message-id=\"a2-r\"\n        ><div class=\"message\" data-avatar=\"none\"\n          ><div class=\"message-content\"\n            ><div class=\"bubble\" data-variant=\"ghost\"\n              ><div class=\"bubble-content\"\n                >A turn marked data-anchor settles near the top of the window when it arrives, with a peek at the\n                previous message - the answer then has the whole window to grow into.</div\n              ></div\n            ></div\n          ></div\n        ></div\n      >\n      <div class=\"session-item\" data-message-id=\"a3\" data-anchor\n        ><div class=\"message\" data-align=\"end\" data-avatar=\"none\"\n          ><div class=\"message-content\"\n            ><div class=\"bubble\"><div class=\"bubble-content\">And while a reply streams?</div></div></div\n          ></div\n        ></div\n      >\n      <div class=\"session-item\" data-message-id=\"a3-r\"\n        ><div class=\"message\" data-avatar=\"none\"\n          ><div class=\"message-content\"\n            ><div class=\"bubble\" data-variant=\"ghost\"\n              ><div class=\"bubble-content\"\n                >The streaming state sets aria-busy on the log, so a screen reader announces the reply once it is\n                complete, and the window follows the growing text while you are at the end.</div\n              ></div\n            ></div\n          ></div\n        ></div\n      >\n    </div>\n    <button\n      type=\"button\"\n      class=\"session-scroll-button\"\n      data-to=\"end\"\n      aria-label=\"Scroll to the latest message\"\n    ></button>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"session-footer\">\n    <form class=\"textarea-group\" data-layout=\"inline\" id=\"ask\" aria-label=\"Ask\">\n      <textarea class=\"textarea\" data-rows=\"1\" data-max-rows=\"4\" placeholder=\"Ask anything\" aria-label=\"Question\">\nHow long can a thread get?</textarea>\n      <div class=\"textarea-group-actions\">\n        <button class=\"btn\" data-size=\"icon-sm\" type=\"submit\" aria-label=\"Send\"><i data-lucide=\"arrow-up\"></i></button>\n      </div>\n    </form>\n  </div>\n</section>\n","individual":true},{"label":"Replay a conversation","html":"<section class=\"session\" id=\"replay\" aria-label=\"A replayed conversation\" data-animate=\"slide\" style=\"height: 26rem\">\n  <div class=\"session-viewport\" aria-label=\"Conversation\">\n  