=\"message-content\"\n              ><div class=\"bubble\"><div class=\"bubble-content\">How do I install it?</div></div></div\n            ></div\n          ></div\n        >\n        <div class=\"session-item\" data-message-id=\"o1-r\"\n          ><div class=\"message\" data-avatar=\"none\"\n            ><div class=\"message-content\"\n              ><div class=\"bubble\" data-variant=\"ghost\"\n                ><div class=\"bubble-content\"\n                  >Add core.css and all.js from the CDN, or npm install defuss-shadcn and import them - the Installation\n                  guide shows both.</div\n                ></div\n              ></div\n            ></div\n          ></div\n        >\n        <div class=\"session-item\" data-message-id=\"o2\" data-anchor\n          ><div class=\"message\" data-align=\"end\" data-avatar=\"none\"\n            ><div class=\"message-content\"\n              ><div class=\"bubble\"><div class=\"bubble-content\">Can I theme it?</div></div></div\n            ></div\n          ></div\n        >\n        <div class=\"session-item\" data-message-id=\"o2-r\"\n          ><div class=\"message\" data-avatar=\"none\"\n            ><div class=\"message-content\"\n              ><div class=\"bubble\" data-variant=\"ghost\"\n                ><div class=\"bubble-content\"\n                  >Load one of the 43 tweakcn presets after the token file, or override single tokens - every component\n                  follows.</div\n                ></div\n              ></div\n            ></div\n          ></div\n        >\n        <div class=\"session-item\" data-message-id=\"o3\" data-anchor\n          ><div class=\"message\" data-align=\"end\" data-avatar=\"none\"\n            ><div class=\"message-content\"\n              ><div class=\"bubble\"><div class=\"bubble-content\">Does it work without JavaScript?</div></div></div\n            ></div\n          ></div\n        >\n        <div class=\"session-item\" data-message-id=\"o3-r\"\n          ><div class=\"message\" data-avatar=\"none\"\n            ><div class=\"message-content\"\n              ><div class=\"bubble\" data-variant=\"ghost\"\n                ><div class=\"bubble-content\"\n                  >Most components are CSS only; the interactive ones enhance native elements, so the basics keep\n                  working.</div\n                ></div\n              ></div\n            ></div\n          ></div\n        >\n        <div class=\"session-item\" data-message-id=\"o4\" data-anchor\n          ><div class=\"message\" data-align=\"end\" data-avatar=\"none\"\n            ><div class=\"message-content\"\n              ><div class=\"bubble\"><div class=\"bubble-content\">How do agents use it?</div></div></div\n            ></div\n          ></div\n        >\n        <div class=\"session-item\" data-message-id=\"o4-r\"\n          ><div class=\"message\" data-avatar=\"none\"\n            ><div class=\"message-content\"\n              ><div class=\"bubble\" data-variant=\"ghost\"\n                ><div class=\"bubble-content\"\n                  >Every component ships a skill: the HTML structure, its states and their names - the agent reads it\n                  and writes the markup.</div\n                ></div\n              ></div\n            ></div\n          ></div\n        >\n        <div class=\"session-item\" data-message-id=\"o5\" data-anchor\n          ><div class=\"message\" data-align=\"end\" data-avatar=\"none\"\n            ><div class=\"message-content\"\n              ><div class=\"bubble\"><div class=\"bubble-content\">What checks the whole thing?</div></div></div\n            ></div\n          ></div\n        >\n        <div class=\"session-item\" data-message-id=\"o5-r\"\n          ><div class=\"message\" data-avatar=\"none\"\n            ><div class=\"message-content\"\n              ><div class=\"bubble\" data-variant=\"ghost\"\n                ><div class=\"bubble-content\"\n                  >The verifier: every build must pass it - screenshots, e2e tests, docs parity, the lot.</div\n                ></div\n              ></div\n            ></div\n          ></div\n        >\n      </div>\n      <button\n        type=\"button\"\n        class=\"session-scroll-button\"\n        data-to=\"end\"\n        aria-label=\"Scroll to the latest message\"\n      ></button>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n</div>\n<style>\n  #outline a {\n    color: var(--muted-foreground);\n    text-decoration: none;\n  }\n  #outline a[aria-current] {\n    color: var(--foreground);\n    font-weight: 600;\n  }\n</style>\n","individual":false}]
